WEBVTT

01:57.240 --> 01:57.920
Need a hand?

01:58.280 --> 01:59.280
No, I'm good.

02:22.680 --> 02:23.240
Hold on tight.

02:34.960 --> 02:35.600
Tell me,

02:36.360 --> 02:37.440
why don't I have

02:37.440 --> 02:39.200
such a pretty cousin?

02:40.920 --> 02:41.920
Ask your aunt.

02:49.360 --> 02:50.720
So many lavender plants.

02:51.880 --> 02:52.960
Stop, stop the motor!

02:52.960 --> 02:53.600
I wanna see.

03:07.800 --> 03:10.120
The lavenders are so pretty!

03:10.800 --> 03:11.960
Look at all of them!

03:12.240 --> 03:13.760
This is just gorgeous!

03:14.760 --> 03:15.320
Pretty?

03:17.400 --> 03:18.120
Not really.

03:21.760 --> 03:23.040
I have nothing to say with someone

03:23.040 --> 03:24.800
who can't appreciate beauty like you.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.360
You see beauty.

03:28.760 --> 03:30.360
I see detox

03:30.360 --> 03:31.160
and anti-itch.

03:31.520 --> 03:32.720
Make it into oil or tea,

03:33.040 --> 03:34.160
it can calm nerves

03:34.320 --> 03:35.000
and ease anxiety.

03:36.040 --> 03:37.120
Mood killer.

03:38.320 --> 03:39.320
I often pass here after work.

03:39.680 --> 03:40.360
Got bored of it.

03:43.240 --> 03:43.760
Thanks.

03:59.079 --> 04:01.120
When you're not at home,

04:01.280 --> 04:02.320
you go to Shunyi to work?

04:04.520 --> 04:06.840
You fix phones,

04:06.840 --> 04:07.720
fix computers,

04:07.880 --> 04:08.960
do all kinds of odd jobs.

04:09.440 --> 04:10.560
You must earn a lot.

04:11.040 --> 04:12.240
Xuan Island's doing well too, right?

04:12.640 --> 04:13.920
So why is your family so tight?

04:14.520 --> 04:15.160
You seemed well off

04:15.160 --> 04:16.000
in Beijing.

04:16.760 --> 04:18.120
How did you end up in Zhazhating?

04:22.760 --> 04:23.200
Oh, right,

04:23.640 --> 04:24.960
Big G said

04:25.400 --> 04:26.640
your grades were not bad.

04:26.880 --> 04:27.800
Why did you drop out?

04:31.440 --> 04:32.240
Your dad pulled strings

04:32.240 --> 04:33.159
to send you here.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.400
He probably wants you to stay.

04:35.520 --> 04:36.440
So why go abroad?

04:42.920 --> 04:43.600
What's wrong with you?

04:44.440 --> 04:45.680
Can't you talk nicely?

04:47.520 --> 04:48.240
When you ask a question,

04:48.240 --> 04:49.159
people has to answer?

04:49.600 --> 04:50.760
You spend money

04:50.760 --> 04:51.560
to hurt others' dignity?

04:52.000 --> 04:52.800
That's arrogance.

04:54.800 --> 04:57.040
You're the one who's biased.

04:58.280 --> 05:00.000
I never meant to hurt anyone.

05:00.760 --> 05:01.440
Besides, I already apologized

05:01.440 --> 05:02.560
for what I said

05:02.560 --> 05:03.600
to your mom that day.

05:04.640 --> 05:06.200
If you don't want to answer,

05:06.800 --> 05:08.080
you can just refuse.

05:09.720 --> 05:10.160
Fine.

05:10.440 --> 05:10.960
I refuse.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.080
Had enough?

05:29.600 --> 05:30.120
No.

05:37.120 --> 05:37.560
Let's go.

05:38.159 --> 05:38.600
Home.

06:03.880 --> 06:04.240
Oh, right.

06:04.960 --> 06:05.840
I'll fix your computer tonight

06:05.840 --> 06:06.680
and bring it back.

06:07.120 --> 06:07.840
From now on,

06:07.960 --> 06:08.880
don't hang around Shunyi.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.080
Why?

06:13.400 --> 06:14.000
It's a hassle.

06:19.160 --> 06:20.920
Is the computer fixed yet?

06:21.520 --> 06:22.200
- Auntie.
- Ye.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.360
Can it be fixed?

06:24.800 --> 06:26.160
Sniper says he can.

06:26.440 --> 06:27.640
- Sniper?
- Sniper?

06:29.760 --> 06:30.360
Xing Wu.

06:30.640 --> 06:31.200
Mr. Zhao.

06:31.960 --> 06:32.800
Sniper?

06:36.920 --> 06:37.720
Big G says

06:37.720 --> 06:39.520
the repair will cost a lot.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.280
Take this.

06:42.840 --> 06:44.280
No, don't worry about it.

06:44.840 --> 06:45.520
It can be fixed.

06:46.200 --> 06:47.440
Take the money back.

06:47.440 --> 06:48.520
She's got money.

06:49.240 --> 06:50.600
I hope it's not a problem.

06:50.840 --> 06:51.240
Grandma.

06:51.440 --> 06:52.040
Not at all.

06:52.360 --> 06:53.680
Sniper works fast.

06:54.840 --> 06:55.760
Good, good.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.840
Sorry for all the trouble.

06:57.840 --> 06:58.760
I feel so sorry.

06:58.880 --> 07:00.240
I bought these sea cucumbers.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.240
Please take them.

07:01.520 --> 07:03.040
Or I won't feel right.

07:03.520 --> 07:04.360
Go on, take them.

07:04.720 --> 07:05.800
Take them.

07:07.840 --> 07:08.280
Fine.

07:09.520 --> 07:10.560
I'll take the sea cucumbers.

07:10.960 --> 07:11.840
You keep the money.

07:12.600 --> 07:13.600
OK then.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.160
I'd better get back

07:15.160 --> 07:16.120
and report to my wife.

07:16.200 --> 07:17.080
Go on, go.

07:17.520 --> 07:18.280
Sorry about this.

07:18.520 --> 07:18.960
No worries.

07:19.000 --> 07:19.560
I'd go back.

07:19.720 --> 07:20.160
Bye.

07:20.240 --> 07:20.840
Take care.

07:22.280 --> 07:23.080
He's henchpecked.

07:23.080 --> 07:24.520
He had to beg his wife for money.

07:25.520 --> 07:26.360
Thank you, Ye.

07:28.200 --> 07:28.680
Um...

07:29.200 --> 07:30.240
The meal Big G made

07:30.600 --> 07:31.400
for you

07:31.400 --> 07:32.240
is still warm on the stove.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.920
I'm going to the next door.

07:34.040 --> 07:34.440
Ok.

07:35.040 --> 07:35.560
Eat it yourself.

07:46.720 --> 07:48.120
Why no charge

07:48.520 --> 07:49.120
this time?

07:50.760 --> 07:51.880
Sea cucumbers for a computer,

07:51.920 --> 07:53.159
fair trade.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.240
Here, take this.

07:59.520 --> 08:00.560
Fix the computer faster.

08:00.880 --> 08:01.640
If you want me out of Xuan Island

08:01.640 --> 08:02.640
as soon as possible.

08:06.240 --> 08:06.680
You're welcome.

08:55.280 --> 08:56.320
"My love".

09:20.000 --> 09:21.960
That poor girl.

09:22.240 --> 09:23.880
Her mom passed away years ago.

09:24.400 --> 09:25.320
If it weren't

09:25.320 --> 09:26.120
for family trouble,

09:26.120 --> 09:26.920
her dad probably wouldn't have

09:26.920 --> 09:27.880
sent her here.

09:36.640 --> 09:38.280
That's my boy!

09:41.240 --> 09:41.880
Where's the money?

09:42.400 --> 09:43.040
Speak up!

09:43.840 --> 09:44.640
Or I'll kill you!

09:45.360 --> 09:46.240
Still silent?

09:48.520 --> 09:49.840
Stop hitting my mom!

09:49.960 --> 09:50.840
You were pregnant with another man's kid

09:50.840 --> 09:52.280
when I married you.

09:52.640 --> 09:53.680
Did I ever complain?

09:54.520 --> 09:55.560
Now the business fails,

09:56.120 --> 09:57.400
you've supported me for years,

09:57.800 --> 09:59.400
and you look down on me?

09:59.760 --> 10:01.080
I'll beat you!

10:01.840 --> 10:03.200
Beat you!

10:03.640 --> 10:04.880
Beat you!

10:05.880 --> 10:06.440
Let go!

10:06.680 --> 10:07.360
Get off!

10:07.560 --> 10:08.520
Wu!

10:08.560 --> 10:09.520
Are you crazy?

10:09.920 --> 10:11.280
How could you hit a child?

10:13.640 --> 10:14.480
Don't cry, don't cry.

10:16.320 --> 10:17.000
Xing Guodong.

10:22.520 --> 10:23.080
Wu.

10:23.520 --> 10:24.000
It's okay.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.360
It's okay.

10:29.880 --> 10:30.520
I'm ok.

11:05.120 --> 11:05.720
Wu.

11:06.360 --> 11:06.800
Tired?

11:07.680 --> 11:08.440
Have some skewers.

11:09.280 --> 11:10.760
I bought from Zhang's.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.320
His cable box broke.

11:12.520 --> 11:13.880
He wants you to fix it.

11:14.440 --> 11:14.800
OK.

11:15.440 --> 11:17.120
His son broke his leg on a site.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.960
Don't expect much pay.

11:20.800 --> 11:21.280
Also,

11:21.640 --> 11:22.320
Mr. Liu's boat engine

11:22.320 --> 11:23.240
keeps stalling.

11:23.360 --> 11:24.200
He wants you to check it.

11:25.000 --> 11:26.040
Got it.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.280
I'll go tomorrow.

11:28.120 --> 11:28.520
OK.

11:30.080 --> 11:30.640
Do you know

11:31.320 --> 11:33.120
what's it like falling from the sky

11:33.600 --> 11:34.360
into the mud?

11:37.120 --> 11:38.520
I'd have to fly to know.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.720
Just like a swap.

12:22.400 --> 12:23.440
[Proof of funds done.]

12:23.800 --> 12:24.320
[All documents ready.]

12:24.320 --> 12:25.120
[Then visa.]

12:27.000 --> 12:29.000
Thanks for saving me, girl.

12:32.880 --> 12:34.800
[All set, except courses.]

12:42.360 --> 12:42.920
Grandma?

12:46.920 --> 12:48.120
Grandma, it's okay!

12:48.160 --> 12:48.960
I'm here!

12:51.040 --> 12:51.600
I'm with you.

12:56.320 --> 12:57.000
It's all right.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.560
You're okay now.

13:45.720 --> 13:46.240
Grandma?

13:47.960 --> 13:48.720
How is she?

13:50.520 --> 13:51.520
She took her meds

13:52.240 --> 13:53.040
and fell asleep.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.000
Good.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.160
Is your hand okay?

14:07.840 --> 14:08.440
Fine.

14:14.320 --> 14:15.160
I fixed your computer.

14:17.960 --> 14:18.600
Thanks.

14:41.960 --> 14:43.720
Great, everything's still here.

14:44.920 --> 14:45.760
Xing Wu

14:45.800 --> 14:47.120
talks rough

14:48.000 --> 14:49.240
but has skills.

15:16.640 --> 15:17.520
Finally done picking courses.

15:19.320 --> 15:20.000
Congrats.

15:21.000 --> 15:22.280
Big life decision.

15:25.800 --> 15:26.680
Congrats to you too.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.920
Soon you'll

15:28.920 --> 15:29.560
get rid of me.

15:32.520 --> 15:33.920
You know yourself well.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.400
I'm happy today,

15:37.760 --> 15:38.720
so I'll let it slide.

15:48.600 --> 15:49.040
What?

15:50.440 --> 15:51.640
Treat that cut.

15:52.120 --> 15:53.560
It's hot, might get infected.

16:03.960 --> 16:06.600
Thank you for today.

16:07.720 --> 16:08.520
It was nothing.

16:09.440 --> 16:10.200
Don't mention it.

16:12.160 --> 16:13.160
You seem to know

16:13.160 --> 16:14.080
how to help patients.

16:14.840 --> 16:15.240
Yes.

16:16.400 --> 16:17.720
My mom was sick

16:17.720 --> 16:18.880
for a while,

16:20.040 --> 16:20.880
so just in case,

16:21.520 --> 16:22.760
I learned

16:23.240 --> 16:24.760
a lot of first aid.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.480
But in the end,

16:31.520 --> 16:32.880
I couldn't save her.

16:43.680 --> 16:44.200
Sorry,

16:45.280 --> 16:46.080
I didn't mean to...

16:53.080 --> 16:53.600
It's fine.

16:54.920 --> 16:56.320
Long day. I'm tired.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.120
I'm going to sleep.

17:02.240 --> 17:02.760
Good night.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.640
Here it comes.

18:21.840 --> 18:22.920
The last dish.

18:23.800 --> 18:24.560
Auntie,

18:24.600 --> 18:26.040
is it a special day?

18:28.280 --> 18:30.000
Yes, it is.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.160
My fault.

18:31.520 --> 18:33.360
I was busy yesterday.

18:33.600 --> 18:34.680
Grandma said

18:35.120 --> 18:36.520
you helped her a lot

18:37.080 --> 18:38.360
and got hurt.

18:39.520 --> 18:41.320
You saved our family.

18:41.520 --> 18:42.520
So I

18:42.840 --> 18:44.120
went early this morning

18:44.360 --> 18:46.320
and bought fresh seafood

18:46.600 --> 18:47.520
just to cook for you.

18:48.080 --> 18:49.160
Isn't that too much?

18:49.520 --> 18:50.840
Not at all.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.960
Grandma, are you okay?

18:53.240 --> 18:53.720
I'm fine.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.360
Just an old condition.

18:56.120 --> 18:57.600
Thanks to you yesterday.

18:58.800 --> 18:59.800
Look,

19:00.640 --> 19:02.120
you suffered.

19:04.000 --> 19:04.520
Wu,

19:05.160 --> 19:06.080
as long as

19:06.080 --> 19:07.120
Ye is here,

19:07.320 --> 19:08.200
you should make sure

19:08.200 --> 19:09.440
that she's comfortable.

19:09.600 --> 19:10.520
Take good care of her,

19:10.840 --> 19:12.280
or I'll hold you responsible.

19:12.840 --> 19:13.720
Don't worry, Grandma.

19:17.880 --> 19:19.840
Let's dig!

19:21.240 --> 19:21.600
Here.

19:21.720 --> 19:22.120
OK.

19:23.800 --> 19:26.240
A shrimp for our Ye.

19:27.080 --> 19:27.640
Thanks, Auntie.

19:27.640 --> 19:29.080
Fresh squid.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.680
Lanfang makes it the best.

19:31.560 --> 19:31.960
OK.

19:32.720 --> 19:34.000
This dish is great.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.760
Some soup for you.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.680
You're installing an AC for me?

20:01.560 --> 20:02.760
A used one from the shop.

20:02.840 --> 20:03.440
Use it for now.

20:06.160 --> 20:07.720
It's not just a used AC.

20:08.080 --> 20:10.160
It's a lifestyle upgrade.

20:59.800 --> 21:00.440
Does your hand still hurt?

21:07.720 --> 21:08.320
Much better.

21:35.120 --> 21:36.760
How long has Grandma been sick?

21:37.560 --> 21:38.600
Two years.

21:39.120 --> 21:39.840
Not just epilepsy.

21:40.280 --> 21:41.400
Her paralysis is also worse.

21:42.360 --> 21:43.320
Sometimes she loses her memory.

21:44.040 --> 21:44.760
Brain diseases can have

21:45.360 --> 21:47.640
all kinds of sudden symptoms.

21:48.040 --> 21:48.720
So

21:49.920 --> 21:50.680
you come back

21:50.880 --> 21:52.520
every day to watch her eat,

21:53.120 --> 21:54.080
in case something happens?

21:55.360 --> 21:56.720
Li Lanfang has no patience.

21:57.120 --> 21:58.520
She often forgets to cook.

21:58.760 --> 21:59.600
So I have to keep an eye.

22:02.040 --> 22:04.080
You take good care of her.

22:06.640 --> 22:07.680
She raised me.

22:08.160 --> 22:09.080
Without her, I'd be nothing.

22:11.360 --> 22:12.400
You're amazing.

22:13.040 --> 22:14.520
We're about the same age,

22:14.640 --> 22:15.960
and you're the man of the house.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.160
But what about your dad?

22:20.080 --> 22:21.040
Never seen him.

22:24.160 --> 22:24.720
Dead.

22:27.760 --> 22:29.200
But I heard

22:29.200 --> 22:30.400
he left town.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.680
Gone so long,

22:32.680 --> 22:33.600
deep in debt.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.080
Might as well be dead.

22:56.960 --> 22:57.440
Done.

23:03.040 --> 23:04.160
So comfortable.

23:04.520 --> 23:05.640
All I need now is

23:05.680 --> 23:06.840
half a chilled watermelon.

23:06.840 --> 23:07.760
It'd be perfect.

23:09.720 --> 23:10.160
Here.

23:11.600 --> 23:12.360
You really have.

23:14.000 --> 23:15.200
Why are you being so nice?

23:17.800 --> 23:19.720
An AC, watermelon...

23:20.240 --> 23:21.320
Not just repaying a favor?

23:22.840 --> 23:23.680
Or do you want my final payment?

23:25.640 --> 23:26.520
Don't want? I'll take it back.

23:26.640 --> 23:27.120
No, no.

23:27.560 --> 23:28.320
I'll eat.

23:36.840 --> 23:37.880
So sweet!

23:39.120 --> 23:40.760
This is how summer should be.

23:42.120 --> 23:42.760
Honestly,

23:43.240 --> 23:44.320
before I came to Zhazhating,

23:44.320 --> 23:45.040
I didn't know

23:45.560 --> 23:47.200
summers by the sea could be this hot.

23:49.080 --> 23:50.080
So

23:50.120 --> 23:51.280
how did you spend summers?

23:52.320 --> 23:53.080
Normally.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.720
You mean

23:55.800 --> 23:57.040
our summers aren't normal?

23:58.440 --> 23:59.760
No, that's not what I meant.

24:00.360 --> 24:01.840
I meant I never

24:01.840 --> 24:02.960
felt the heat.

24:03.320 --> 24:04.560
Everywhere was cool.

24:04.880 --> 24:06.760
Home had a ventilation system,

24:06.840 --> 24:08.000
malls had AC.

24:09.760 --> 24:10.600
You never went out?

24:11.560 --> 24:12.400
I had a driver.

24:13.120 --> 24:14.840
If it got too hot, I'd go abroad

24:15.160 --> 24:16.360
to somewhere cooler.

24:17.520 --> 24:18.080
But

24:18.680 --> 24:19.960
most of the time,

24:20.520 --> 24:21.280
I stayed home

24:21.280 --> 24:22.520
with a tutor.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.960
Sounds nice.

24:26.560 --> 24:27.160
It was okay.

24:27.400 --> 24:27.840
What about you?

24:28.520 --> 24:28.960
Me?

24:30.760 --> 24:31.520
Simple.

24:32.000 --> 24:34.000
Run between Xuan Island and Shunyi.

24:34.120 --> 24:34.760
Work if there's work.

24:35.480 --> 24:36.560
If it's too hot,

24:36.760 --> 24:37.760
go swimming

24:38.200 --> 24:39.360
with Kyle and Big G.

24:41.720 --> 24:42.640
Pretty wild.

24:44.240 --> 24:45.320
But tough.

24:49.360 --> 24:50.800
It must have been hard for you

24:51.320 --> 24:52.400
coming from Beijing to Zhazhating.

25:05.040 --> 25:05.600
But

25:07.200 --> 25:08.000
today,

25:08.800 --> 25:10.520
for the first time since I got here,

25:11.920 --> 25:12.880
I don't feel

25:14.160 --> 25:14.920
so miserable.

25:17.520 --> 25:18.640
Because of this used AC?

25:21.320 --> 25:22.440
Not just the AC.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.640
The new lock,

25:26.280 --> 25:26.920
the showerhead,

25:28.520 --> 25:29.680
the watermelon,

25:30.120 --> 25:31.440
and you fixing my computer.

25:38.000 --> 25:38.640
And...

25:57.440 --> 25:58.200
I'm going.

26:00.200 --> 26:01.040
And thank you

26:04.400 --> 26:06.280
for making this summer in Zhazhating

26:08.280 --> 26:09.400
less desperate.

27:12.240 --> 27:13.720
Who's so shameless

27:14.080 --> 27:15.320
to steal clothes?

27:16.920 --> 27:18.200
Which lowlife

27:18.600 --> 27:20.280
stole a girl's clothes?

27:22.720 --> 27:23.760
That desperate?

27:26.960 --> 27:28.280
No decency!

27:29.120 --> 27:30.640
After a few pieces of cloth?

27:30.840 --> 27:31.880
Are you even human?

27:32.240 --> 27:33.520
What's wrong, Auntie?

27:33.520 --> 27:34.440
Early in the morning...

27:35.320 --> 27:36.560
Your clothes...

27:36.560 --> 27:38.160
Your clothes got stolen.

27:38.960 --> 27:40.120
I didn't wash any.

27:40.240 --> 27:41.520
I did.

27:41.520 --> 27:42.200
I saw your clothes

27:42.200 --> 27:42.800
there yesterday

27:42.800 --> 27:44.040
and washed them.

27:44.160 --> 27:44.920
My fault.

27:44.920 --> 27:45.840
It's my bad.

27:45.840 --> 27:46.680
If I hadn't,

27:46.680 --> 27:48.040
this wouldn't have happened.

27:49.040 --> 27:50.040
You didn't mean to.

27:50.840 --> 27:53.080
But your bra

27:53.600 --> 27:54.560
is gone.

27:56.040 --> 27:57.000
Maybe a mistake?

27:57.240 --> 27:58.880
Who'd steal bra?

27:59.640 --> 28:00.920
In Zhazhating,

28:01.320 --> 28:02.520
let alone bra.

28:03.880 --> 28:05.000
Even the copper wire

28:05.000 --> 28:06.120
off poles.

28:06.520 --> 28:08.040
Someone'll take it.

28:09.080 --> 28:10.640
Give the clothes back! Now!

28:11.880 --> 28:12.840
What's all this?

28:12.840 --> 28:14.200
You two going at it

28:14.200 --> 28:14.920
this early?

28:16.920 --> 28:18.080
Solving a mystery?

28:18.720 --> 28:19.880
Catch the thief yet?

28:20.240 --> 28:20.800
Not yet.

28:21.440 --> 28:22.600
Still looking.

28:23.520 --> 28:24.920
This yard

28:25.560 --> 28:26.760
is so small.

28:27.120 --> 28:29.160
Just a few families.

28:29.440 --> 28:31.640
Everyone knows who's sneaky.

28:31.640 --> 28:32.960
We all know.

28:33.440 --> 28:34.960
I hung clothes yesterday.

28:35.720 --> 28:36.840
Did you see anything?

28:39.240 --> 28:40.840
I've been swamped,

28:40.880 --> 28:42.000
run off my feet.

28:42.560 --> 28:43.240
What did you say?

28:43.240 --> 28:44.360
Your clothes are missing?

28:45.000 --> 28:45.720
I didn't see.

28:47.320 --> 28:48.200
Didn't see anything.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.640
Didn't see? Then why ask?

28:51.320 --> 28:52.680
Who took them, bring them back.

28:52.680 --> 28:53.200
What happened?

28:54.400 --> 28:55.600
What's wrong with you people?

28:55.600 --> 28:56.560
You steal everything!

28:56.560 --> 28:57.520
Computers, bra.

28:57.760 --> 28:58.520
Wearing someone else's bra?

28:58.520 --> 28:59.280
Isn't that gross?

28:59.840 --> 29:00.520
Zhazhating and I

29:00.520 --> 29:01.560
just don't mix.

29:01.560 --> 29:02.600
So annoying!

29:07.160 --> 29:08.080
Was it hanging here?

29:09.400 --> 29:10.720
I left it here last night,

29:10.720 --> 29:11.800
and it's gone this morning.

29:14.760 --> 29:15.880
Annoying.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.000
Good?

30:07.880 --> 30:08.520
Yeah.

30:09.200 --> 30:10.320
Want a piece, Wu?

30:10.800 --> 30:11.600
Where are Qing Ye's clothes?

30:12.800 --> 30:13.520
I didn't steal them.

30:14.200 --> 30:15.040
Did I say you did?

30:15.520 --> 30:15.880
I...

30:20.600 --> 30:21.120
What?

30:22.120 --> 30:23.160
What about the footprints

30:23.160 --> 30:23.840
under the clothesline?

30:24.800 --> 30:25.600
Footprints.

30:26.280 --> 30:26.880
They're everywhere.

30:26.880 --> 30:28.040
That's from hanging clothes.

30:28.360 --> 30:29.160
What's that got to do with me?

30:32.920 --> 30:33.640
Xing Wu.

30:34.400 --> 30:35.120
I tell you.

30:35.160 --> 30:36.400
Don't push it.

30:36.520 --> 30:37.600
I have a temper too.

30:37.600 --> 30:38.120
Got it?

30:39.120 --> 30:39.920
Wu, Wu, Wu.

30:40.040 --> 30:41.120
You stole the computer too. Right?

30:41.160 --> 30:41.840
Not me.

30:41.840 --> 30:42.640
I wouldn't dare.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.640
I might take wire,

30:43.640 --> 30:44.800
but not a computer.

30:47.080 --> 30:47.520
What?

30:48.880 --> 30:49.360
Wu.

30:49.520 --> 30:51.120
Hot, hot, hot!

30:51.160 --> 30:53.080
My face! Wu.

30:53.440 --> 30:54.520
I'm sorry, Wu.

30:54.680 --> 30:55.280
I'm sorry!

30:56.440 --> 30:56.960
Wu Laoer,

30:57.800 --> 30:58.440
listen up.

30:59.000 --> 31:00.080
Don't you dare eye Qing Ye.

31:00.600 --> 31:01.360
Or next time,

31:01.760 --> 31:03.000
I'll send you to the King of Hell.

31:03.080 --> 31:04.160
OK, OK, Wu.

31:04.320 --> 31:05.600
I promise. I promise!

31:22.160 --> 31:22.880
What are you looking at?

31:23.760 --> 31:25.000
Never seen picking up shoes?

31:26.800 --> 31:28.600
Come in, come in.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.520
Pick whatever you want.

31:35.560 --> 31:37.200
Wear what you like.

31:37.880 --> 31:38.760
These are all

31:38.800 --> 31:39.600
my prized clothes.

31:40.960 --> 31:41.800
No need, Auntie.

31:42.120 --> 31:43.680
I only lost one bra.

31:43.920 --> 31:45.360
You don't have to lend me yours.

31:47.000 --> 31:48.600
I see you only have

31:48.600 --> 31:49.920
a few outfits.

31:50.360 --> 31:52.080
Did you not bring enough?

31:53.680 --> 31:54.680
Don't worry,

31:55.000 --> 31:57.080
My clothes are pretty.

31:57.360 --> 31:58.400
I learned fashion

31:58.400 --> 31:59.600
from your mom.

32:01.840 --> 32:03.240
This was the trend

32:03.240 --> 32:04.280
when I was young.

32:04.760 --> 32:05.560
Pretty, right?

32:06.040 --> 32:06.560
Try it.

32:07.200 --> 32:08.000
Me? No, no, no.

32:08.000 --> 32:09.320
Try it, try it.

32:09.320 --> 32:09.920
- No.
- Try it.

32:09.920 --> 32:11.120
Come on, it's cute.

32:11.320 --> 32:12.760
Trust me.

32:12.840 --> 32:14.120
It looks good.

32:15.040 --> 32:17.600
Come out, it's fine.

32:17.960 --> 32:18.680
Come on, come out.

32:19.440 --> 32:20.040
Wu,

32:20.760 --> 32:21.680
where have you been?

32:22.520 --> 32:23.240
Working out.

32:23.760 --> 32:24.560
Perfect timing.

32:24.880 --> 32:25.520
Um...

32:26.000 --> 32:27.400
Ye's a bit shy.

32:27.440 --> 32:28.920
You can help us decide.

32:29.720 --> 32:30.280
What do you mean?

32:32.280 --> 32:33.280
Just come out.

32:33.280 --> 32:34.200
Come on, come out.

32:34.240 --> 32:35.640
My clothes look great.

32:35.880 --> 32:37.080
Well? Good?

32:39.360 --> 32:40.120
What are you laughing at?

32:40.120 --> 32:41.560
You don't have to speak.

32:42.680 --> 32:43.280
I'll stay silent.

32:46.360 --> 32:46.800
Change.

32:47.440 --> 32:47.920
Let's change.

32:48.400 --> 32:49.840
We'll find the one you like.

32:50.120 --> 32:50.520
Let's go.

32:50.960 --> 32:51.440
These are

32:51.440 --> 32:53.080
my favorite clothes I rarely wear.

32:54.920 --> 32:55.440
Xing Wu.

32:57.800 --> 32:58.360
Look at this.

32:58.520 --> 32:59.000
How is it?

33:07.520 --> 33:07.880
Got it.

33:08.200 --> 33:08.680
Change again.

33:09.320 --> 33:09.720
Let's go.

33:31.800 --> 33:32.400
Maybe

33:32.840 --> 33:34.040
I should pick for myself.

33:35.200 --> 33:35.720
OK.

33:36.160 --> 33:36.960
Pick what you like.

33:37.040 --> 33:37.520
Anything.

33:45.320 --> 33:46.200
Doesn't look good?

34:18.600 --> 34:19.840
What do you think, Auntie?

34:21.520 --> 34:23.520
Just like your mom back in the day.

34:27.360 --> 34:28.760
Such long legs.

34:29.679 --> 34:30.639
Beautiful.

34:37.840 --> 34:38.239
Mom.

34:38.520 --> 34:39.120
Come here.

34:43.600 --> 34:44.120
What?

34:45.000 --> 34:45.600
Later,

34:45.880 --> 34:47.000
go buy Qing Ye

34:47.000 --> 34:47.800
two outfits.

34:48.560 --> 34:49.320
I'm busy.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.600
Play less mahjong,

34:50.600 --> 34:51.320
and you'll have time.

34:51.600 --> 34:54.159
Zhao Pock's son is getting married tomorrow.

34:54.159 --> 34:54.880
Tonight is

34:54.880 --> 34:55.920
the pre-wedding feast.

34:56.040 --> 34:57.280
I promised Big G's mom,

34:57.280 --> 34:57.880
Kyle's mom,

34:57.880 --> 34:58.720
I'd go help.

34:58.720 --> 35:00.040
I have to go soon.

35:01.520 --> 35:01.920
In a hurry?

35:03.120 --> 35:03.560
Very.

35:03.720 --> 35:04.400
See?

35:04.400 --> 35:05.360
They're already calling.

35:08.680 --> 35:09.920
Just let her wear mine.

35:09.920 --> 35:11.160
Then who'll buy for her?

35:11.280 --> 35:12.680
You figure it out.

35:13.680 --> 35:15.440
I'll take Grandma over.

35:15.720 --> 35:16.280
Later,

35:16.280 --> 35:17.120
you bring Ye.

35:17.760 --> 35:19.760
We paid for the feast.

35:19.760 --> 35:20.520
So eat our money's worth.

35:20.960 --> 35:21.400
Here we go again.

35:25.200 --> 35:27.560
Hold the sky with both hands.

35:29.240 --> 35:30.440
Press up.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.360
Down.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.880
You know Baduanjin?

35:42.280 --> 35:44.120
Started three minutes ago.

35:48.000 --> 35:49.520
I'm going to the county to shop.

35:49.760 --> 35:50.400
Wanna come?

35:51.520 --> 35:52.040
No.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.760
First my computer,

35:54.760 --> 35:55.520
then my clothes.

35:55.720 --> 35:56.280
I think

35:56.280 --> 35:57.320
before I leave,

35:58.000 --> 36:00.600
I'll just practice turtle breathing

36:00.800 --> 36:01.760
and stay calm.

36:04.320 --> 36:04.720
Fine.

36:05.160 --> 36:05.600
I'm off.

36:06.280 --> 36:06.720
Wait.

36:09.440 --> 36:09.880
Can you...

36:10.840 --> 36:11.640
Um...

36:12.640 --> 36:14.280
get me something...

36:19.680 --> 36:21.040
to wear inside?

36:21.440 --> 36:22.040
You know?

36:24.280 --> 36:25.360
One-size type.

36:26.720 --> 36:27.160
OK.

37:01.000 --> 37:01.360
Hello?

37:01.840 --> 37:02.240
[Wu,]

37:02.400 --> 37:02.920
[got a job.]

37:03.280 --> 37:03.840
[Come to Shunyi.]

37:04.280 --> 37:05.720
Are you spying on me?

37:06.680 --> 37:07.400
[What do you mean?]

37:07.680 --> 37:08.200
Nothing.

37:08.920 --> 37:09.440
I'll be right there.

37:11.280 --> 37:12.280
My sister found you the job.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.920
Isn't she in Hainan?

37:16.640 --> 37:17.720
She knows you need money.

37:17.920 --> 37:18.920
She's always looking out for you.

37:19.440 --> 37:20.320
She treats you

37:20.680 --> 37:21.680
better than me,

37:21.720 --> 37:22.320
her own brother.

37:22.800 --> 37:24.360
Stop joking. What's the job?

37:25.120 --> 37:26.120
What's the deal?

37:26.520 --> 37:27.640
Her boss, Mr. Ye,

37:28.400 --> 37:30.040
wants a model plane for his son's competition.

37:30.720 --> 37:31.680
Needs someone to build it.

37:31.880 --> 37:33.160
She recommended you.

37:33.680 --> 37:34.720
Gas-powered.

37:40.400 --> 37:41.040
But I only know a little

37:41.040 --> 37:41.960
about that.

37:42.960 --> 37:43.720
What model plane

37:43.720 --> 37:44.720
can't you make?

37:45.320 --> 37:46.320
One thing leads to another.

37:46.880 --> 37:48.240
It can't be that hard.

37:49.720 --> 37:50.880
I lack theory.

37:51.280 --> 37:52.680
Keeping it light

37:52.680 --> 37:53.360
and agile

37:54.200 --> 37:54.840
is tricky.

37:55.960 --> 37:56.680
With your sister's

37:56.680 --> 37:57.520
connections,

37:57.720 --> 37:58.680
she could easily

37:58.680 --> 37:59.400
find an expert.

38:00.280 --> 38:01.120
What expert

38:01.280 --> 38:02.360
could be better than you?

38:03.920 --> 38:04.840
So, how is it?

38:04.920 --> 38:05.360
You in?

38:10.320 --> 38:12.360
Such a plane isn't cheap.

38:13.320 --> 38:14.000
She said

38:14.320 --> 38:15.080
if you do it well,

38:15.400 --> 38:16.280
price isn't an issue.

38:20.560 --> 38:21.040
8000.

38:22.320 --> 38:23.160
I'll tell her.

38:32.760 --> 38:34.200
She said deal.

38:35.680 --> 38:36.080
OK.

38:36.440 --> 38:37.320
Thank her for me.

38:38.200 --> 38:39.360
Thank her yourself in person.

38:39.560 --> 38:40.760
She'd like that.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.720
You really plan to just lie there?

39:05.640 --> 39:07.000
If I don't move,

39:07.560 --> 39:08.520
I won't be defeated.

39:10.480 --> 39:11.640
I thought you were so rebellious

39:11.960 --> 39:13.400
from how you fought me.

39:14.720 --> 39:15.760
All that rebellion

39:16.080 --> 39:17.200
needs clothes to cover.

39:18.160 --> 39:19.640
My online order arrives in a few days.

39:22.400 --> 39:22.800
What's this?

39:23.840 --> 39:25.240
This should be what you wanted.

39:28.800 --> 39:29.960
Try it on later.

39:30.320 --> 39:31.200
If it doesn't fit, I'll exchange.

39:33.200 --> 39:33.600
Got it.

39:37.160 --> 39:38.440
Can you get up now?

39:39.800 --> 39:40.240
Why?

39:40.600 --> 39:41.760
Zhao Pock's son is getting married.

39:42.160 --> 39:43.280
Come get some good luck.

39:43.280 --> 39:43.880
Shake off the bad.

39:44.520 --> 39:45.960
You have weddings at night?

39:46.080 --> 39:47.400
Not the real wedding.

39:47.800 --> 39:48.760
The night before,

39:49.080 --> 39:50.560
neighbors gather for drinks.

39:52.680 --> 39:53.560
Wu!

39:53.600 --> 39:54.720
Cousin!

39:56.040 --> 39:56.760
Cousin!

39:57.400 --> 39:57.960
Wu!

39:58.160 --> 39:58.920
Qing Ye!

39:59.160 --> 40:00.400
Let's go feast!

40:03.360 --> 40:04.400
Go, go, go!

40:04.520 --> 40:05.160
Let's go!

40:07.320 --> 40:07.880
You coming?

40:12.640 --> 40:13.520
Coming!

40:14.400 --> 40:14.920
Congrats.

40:15.000 --> 40:16.000
Thanks!

40:17.120 --> 40:18.680
Go on, get them seated.

40:19.320 --> 40:19.800
Coming!

40:20.120 --> 40:20.840
I'm coming!

40:20.880 --> 40:21.840
Thanks, thanks!

40:25.040 --> 40:25.600
Fen,

40:25.680 --> 40:27.320
tell them to bring cold dishes first.

40:27.320 --> 40:28.080
OK!

40:28.160 --> 40:28.920
Big G's mom!

40:29.760 --> 40:31.520
Honey, cold dishes first.

40:32.440 --> 40:33.600
Come on.

40:33.880 --> 40:35.320
Yu, is the water boiling?

40:35.640 --> 40:36.760
Almost, almost ready.

40:37.600 --> 40:38.640
Turn down the heat.

40:39.400 --> 40:40.720
Here it comes!

40:43.360 --> 40:45.120
Take some candy.

40:45.440 --> 40:45.920
Come on.

40:46.400 --> 40:47.840
Ok, take it.

40:47.840 --> 40:49.000
Thank you all.

40:50.800 --> 40:51.560
Dishes coming!

40:51.640 --> 40:52.720
Ribs!

40:53.720 --> 40:54.680
Please sit.

40:54.800 --> 40:55.960
Everyone sit.

40:56.040 --> 40:56.360
Sit down.

40:56.520 --> 40:57.640
Have some nuts.

40:58.080 --> 40:59.320
Eat, eat. Sit, sit.

40:59.720 --> 41:00.760
Sit down.

41:01.160 --> 41:02.000
Everyone take a seat.

41:02.000 --> 41:02.840
Thanks for your hard work.

41:02.920 --> 41:03.960
Thank you very much.

41:16.000 --> 41:17.080
Such a big spread.

41:18.720 --> 41:19.520
Impressed?

41:20.080 --> 41:20.960
This is how we

41:20.960 --> 41:21.800
feast in Zhazhating.

41:23.080 --> 41:23.760
Amazing.

41:25.560 --> 41:26.840
Wu! Cousin!

41:27.640 --> 41:28.400
Over here, over here!

41:28.440 --> 41:28.960
Where?

41:29.080 --> 41:30.160
There, this way.

41:30.720 --> 41:31.200
Let's go.

41:32.320 --> 41:33.080
Wu, Qing Ye.

41:33.120 --> 41:33.960
Welcome, sit down.

41:34.040 --> 41:35.160
Food's almost ready.

41:35.280 --> 41:36.160
Take care of them.

41:38.040 --> 41:38.440
Sit, sit.

41:38.520 --> 41:40.080
I'll drink with you tonight.

41:40.280 --> 41:41.400
Drink up.

41:41.640 --> 41:42.000
Let's eat.

41:42.360 --> 41:43.160
I'll be right back.

41:43.160 --> 41:44.080
What do you want to drink, cousin?

41:44.200 --> 41:44.840
Beer.

41:45.520 --> 41:46.320
Can you handle it?

41:46.320 --> 41:47.520
Maybe a soft drink?

41:47.800 --> 41:48.680
I'm an adult.

41:48.760 --> 41:50.800
So am I. I have a license.

41:51.120 --> 41:52.080
Sit, sit.

42:01.200 --> 42:01.800
What are you looking at?

42:03.200 --> 42:03.640
Gang.

42:03.880 --> 42:04.240
Here.

42:05.160 --> 42:05.680
Go away.

42:06.800 --> 42:07.920
That computer you sold me,

42:08.240 --> 42:09.000
where'd you steal it?

42:09.440 --> 42:10.080
From that girl

42:10.080 --> 42:10.680
next to Xing Wu?

42:11.520 --> 42:12.240
No, Gang.

42:12.440 --> 42:12.840
It's...

42:13.560 --> 42:14.200
It's not stolen.

42:14.480 --> 42:15.600
Don't say that.

42:16.000 --> 42:16.520
Right.

42:16.760 --> 42:17.520
Not stolen.

42:17.720 --> 42:18.560
She gave it to you.

42:20.240 --> 42:20.840
Wait, Gang.

42:26.520 --> 42:28.520
Dear friends,

42:28.600 --> 42:29.880
and neighbors,

42:30.120 --> 42:32.240
thank you all for

42:32.240 --> 42:33.880
taking time out of busy

42:34.040 --> 42:35.160
to celebrate with us.

42:35.600 --> 42:37.560
Me and my wife thank you all.

42:37.600 --> 42:38.520
Thank you!

42:38.520 --> 42:40.520
Good! Good!

42:41.520 --> 42:44.280
Alright! In short,

42:44.640 --> 42:45.520
enjoy the food,

42:45.640 --> 42:46.400
enjoy the drinks.

42:46.960 --> 42:47.960
Let's eat!

42:48.200 --> 42:48.720
Dig in!

42:48.720 --> 42:50.080
Great!

42:50.160 --> 42:50.680
Time to eat!

42:50.760 --> 42:51.480
Come on.

42:51.840 --> 42:52.400
Come on.

42:52.440 --> 42:53.040
Main dishes coming!

42:53.680 --> 42:54.640
Here we go.

42:55.240 --> 42:56.520
Cheers!

42:59.120 --> 43:00.080
Your

43:00.360 --> 43:02.120
wedding food is so rich.

43:02.520 --> 43:03.440
Of course.

43:03.600 --> 43:05.040
Marriage is a big deal.

43:05.160 --> 43:06.080
Gotta go all out.

43:06.200 --> 43:06.720
This dish

43:06.960 --> 43:08.160
is our holiday special

43:08.160 --> 43:09.600
in Zhazhating.

43:09.760 --> 43:11.000
"Fated to be Three."

43:11.120 --> 43:12.440
Braised sea cucumber with tendon.

43:12.720 --> 43:13.280
And that one?

43:14.680 --> 43:16.520
"Perfect Match Family Fortune."

43:18.440 --> 43:20.160
Every dish has a lucky name.

43:21.520 --> 43:22.520
Looks pretty tasty.

43:26.800 --> 43:27.320
Qing Ye,

43:27.520 --> 43:28.440
that is

43:28.560 --> 43:29.560
our Zhazhating style.

43:30.520 --> 43:31.120
Quick hands get the food,

43:31.800 --> 43:32.520
slow hands miss out.

43:32.520 --> 43:33.120
Here comes ours.

43:34.440 --> 43:34.840
Come on.

43:36.440 --> 43:37.280
I'll just use my hands.

43:41.280 --> 43:41.960
You look happy!
